title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › The live check
route: /authorizations/eligibility/verify
intro: The right-hand 'Live check' card. Each agent asks one question, in order, and ticks it off. About 10 seconds in all. The two outside questions are simulated in the demo.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the state and the plan never really reply. The answers are scripted from the member ID and the plan (see 'The check finishes and is saved').
---
start s1 "Click 'Check now'"
process p1 "Form, 'Use sample card' and the card drop lock\nButton reads 'Checking' with a spinner"
screen sc "Card 'Live check'\n'Each agent asks the right source and reports back'\nTimer pill 0:00, one row per agent, all 'Waiting' and dimmed"

group gR "1 Reader"
  agent a1 "Reader\n'Reading the card and filling in the details'\nor 'Taking the member ID and date of birth as typed'"
  wait w1 "About 1.4 seconds"
  process d1 "Row ticks, shows 0:01\n'Read the card and filled in the details' or 'Took the member ID and date of birth as typed'"
endgroup

group gS "2 Eligibility with the state or plan"
  agent a2 "Verify\n'Asking Ohio Medicaid whether coverage is active on 10/21/2026'"
  ext x2 "Ohio Medicaid, or the plan itself for Beacon, Harborview and Lakeshore\nReal step: a 270/271 eligibility inquiry (demo: simulated)"
  wait w2 "About 2.4 seconds"
  process d2 "Row ticks, shows 0:02\n'Asked Ohio Medicaid: coverage is active on 10/21/2026'\nor 'coverage lapsed 10/12', or 'no coverage found for these details'"
endgroup

group gB "3 Benefits with the plan"
  agent a3 "Verify\n'Asking Summit what Residential 3.5 covers'"
  ext x3 "The plan answers for the service codes\nReal step: benefit detail by service type (demo: simulated)"
  wait w3 "About 2.6 seconds"
  process d3 "Row ticks, shows 0:03\n'Summit covers Residential 3.5 (H0018 and H0019)'"
endgroup

decision q1 "Is the payer Evergreen?"
agent a4 "Caller\n'Evergreen did not answer online. Caller is phoning'"

group gA "4 Authorization rule"
  agent a5 "Criteria\n'Checking whether an authorization is required'"
  wait w5 "About 1.6 seconds"
  process d5 "Row ticks\n'An authorization is required before the first day'\nor 'Beacon does not require an authorization' (IOP, PHP)"
endgroup

group gN "5 Clinic enrollment"
  agent a6 "Navigator\n'Checking that the clinic is enrolled to bill Summit'"
  wait w6 "About 1.8 seconds"
  process d6 "Row ticks\n'The clinic is enrolled and in network'\nor 'The clinic is not enrolled for this program'"
endgroup

click k1 "Click 'Skip ahead' (shown only while running)"
process p2 "Every step still to run takes 0.15 seconds"
process p3 "Timer pill counts up in seconds, 0:00 to about 0:10"
toast t1 "Banner 'All answers are in. Opening the result.'"
wait w9 "Half a second so the last tick is seen"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › The check finishes and is saved"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › When a system does not answer"

s1 --> p1 --> sc --> a1 --> w1 --> d1 --> a2
a2 --> x2 --> w2 --> d2 --> a3
a3 --> x3 --> w3 --> d3 --> q1
q1 -->|No| a5
q1 -->|Yes| a4 --> a5
a4 -.-> g2
a5 --> w5 --> d5 --> a6 --> w6 --> d6 --> t1 --> w9 --> g1
sc -.-> p3
sc -.-> k1 --> p2 -.-> t1
